{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2023-03-09 08:15:00', 'title': 'BAKKT CRYPTO REWARDS COMES TO LAS VEGAS STRIP WITH CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT', 'text': 'ALPHARETTA, GA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BAKKT HOLDINGS, INC. (“BAKKT”), A TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT ENABLES PARTNERS TO UNLOCK CRYPTO AND DRIVE LOYALTY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A DEAL WITH CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT (“CAESARS”), THE LARGEST CASINO-ENTERTAINMENT COMPANY IN THE U.S. TO LAUNCH THIS PAIRING, THE STATE-OF-THE-ART LIVE ENTERTAINMENT VENUE AT PLANET HOLLYWOOD RESORT & CASINO, FORMERLY KNOWN AS ZAPPOS THEATER, WILL BE RENAMED BAKKT THEATER.'}